<title>USA: West Africa cocoa areas seen staying hot and dry.</title>
<headline>West Africa cocoa areas seen staying hot and dry.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hot, dry weather continues in West Africa's cocoa areas, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The outlook is for dry weather and above normal temperatures today and Thursday, with little change from Friday to Sunday.</p>
<p>Conditions are possibly stressing crops in Ivory Coast, it added.</p>
</text>
